    "detailed_description": "Astro-g is a gravity-based space puzzler, challenging players with over 40 unique levels and environments to conquer! You\u2019ve only got one shot to make it to the portal, and it\u2019ll take all you\u2019ve got to weave together a safe path to victory. With four galaxies to explore and a number of environmental surprises, there\u2019s a lot to discover on your way back home. Challenge yourself to achieve perfection by seeking out better times and inventive paths through the levels.",
